      "content": "but it's just like a dull ache most of the time, only occasionally it gets sharp. it doesnt feel like an emergency though, i can still walk around and do stuff. isn't it possible it's just bad indigestion or something i ate? honestly i feel like i can handle it if i just take some strong stuff to get it moving. what's the safest thing i can take right now just to see if it goes away? i really just want to sleep this off.",
